},indent=2))\npathlib.Path('PROGRESS.md').write_text('# Progress\\\\n\\\\n## Requirements\\\\n- Build PLAN.md using TASK.md. Single HTML at root; dev files in named subfolder.\\\\n- Engine must remain unmodified; code-generated audio; 10% music; controller-first; 10-second attract; pause Dev Mode; AI Hub and couch co-op.\\\\n- Required exit-interview.json and in-game credits/feedback.\\\\n\\\\n## Identity\\\\n- Title: '+title+'\\\\n- Dev folder/output stem: '+slug+'\\\\n- Title selected with cryptographic RNG from 50 candidates, recorded in title-selection.json.\\\\n\\\\n## Current work\\\\n- Reading full plan and engine/hub requirements.\\\\n- Supplied testing-toolkit path does not exist; standard installed tools remain available.\\\\n\\\\n## Completed\\\\n- Read TASK.md; workspace starts with PLAN.md and TASK.md only.\\\\n\\\\n## Next\\\\n1. Download engine, read guide/assets/API and hub contract.\\\\n2. Implement deterministic surgical simulation, campaign, rendering, input, audio and menus.\\\\n3. Package, verify full game/hub/screens, update feedback.\\\\n')\nprint(json.dumps({'title':title,'folder':slug}))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"{\"title\": \"Trauma Ward: Critical Opinion\", \"folder\": \"Trauma-Ward-Critical-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-031206\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
