era rig, input, audio context and debug UI stay).\n197:### ENGINE_VERSION\n203:### interface EngineOptions\n226:### FPS_OPTIONS\n232:### class FrameLimiter\n242:### frameView()\n248:The framing and art resolution of a view (PixelRenderer's canvas, or a HeadlessView's viewport):\n253:### interface Framing\n259:- `readonly canvasWidth: number`: Canvas backing-store size in device pixels.\n260:- `readonly canvasHeight: number`\n266:### interface Game\n288:### interface GameContext\n299:- `readonly audio: AudioManager`: Sound effects, music, volumes (src/engine/audio).\n305:### interface HeadlessOptions\n312:### class LoadingScreen\n323:### loadSettings()\n331:### normalizeSettings()\n339:### optionsFromUrl()\n352:### PIXEL_SIZES\n358:### interface PlayerSettings\n361:(sound is the AudioManager's, which keeps its own volumes). A field left out is the game's own\n372:### QUALITY\n381:### QUALITY_LEVELS\n387:### QUALITY_OPTIONS\n393:### type QualityLevel\n407:### type QualityOption\n413:### interface QualitySettings\n418:### rebindDebugKeys()\n428:### interface Resolution\n432:The canvas backing store is sized to `art × scale` device pixels with an integer\n434:art pixel therefore covers an integer block of device pixels, and the canvas is centered\n446:### RESOLUTIONS\n452:### resolveDebugKeys()\n460:### class Settings\n479:### interface SettingsHost\n492:### class SettingsPanel\n496:settings.ts; the AudioManager's volumes). The engine pauses the game while it is open. Keys\n507:### storeSettings()\n513:### urlSettings()\n523:### interface Viewport\n531:### withUrlOptions()\n542:## 2. Camera\n544:### CAMERA_PRESETS\n550:### interface CameraConfig\n566:### type CameraPreset\n577:### class CameraRig\n604:### interface CameraRigState\n617:### createCameraRig()\n623:### class FirstPersonRig\n637:### class FreeRig\n655:### class OrthoRig\n666:### class ThirdPersonRig\n677:## 3. Rendering, looks and filters\n679:### AMOUNT\n687:### applyFilter()\n696:### applyFilters()\n704:### type BackendName\n712:### interface CapturedFrame\n718:### clampParam()\n726:### cloneLook()\n732:### DEFAULT_EDGES\n738:### DEFAULT_PIXEL\n744:### defaultLook()\n752:### defaultParams()\n760:### interface EdgeSettings\n765:### FILTER_IDS\n771:### FILTER_PRESETS\n779:### interface FilterContext\n786:### interface FilterDef\n798:### type FilterGroup\n804:### filterOrder()\n812:### interface FilterParam\n824:### filterParams()\n832:### filterPresetOf()\n842:### filterPresets()\n850:### FILTERS\n856:### type FilterSpace\n862:### getFilter()\n868:### interface LayerLook\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
