{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md')\np.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Implementation checkpoint\\\\n- Downloaded Pixel Engine 0.46.0; read full GUIDE.md and ASSETS.md and relevant API signatures. Engine source unmodified; build checks SHA-256 against zip.\\\\n- Downloaded unmodified Hub v1 client 1.4.0 and official harness/bridge/round; read protocol.\\\\n- Implemented all 10 original operations, all eight instrument rules, composure gifts, Code Blue, bone rotation, transplant, triage, four boss types, massage, 4-seat Consult.\\\\n- Deterministic pure simulation and bot complete all 11 operation definitions in Node. Two simulation issues fixed: bot switching wounds mid-trace, and repeated forced rewind.\\\\n- Added all original story scenes and cast; custom native model portraits, hand, eight tools and hero-rig figures; procedural tissue, 7 hospital sets.\\\\n- Added code-generated formant voices, SFX, original songs; music defaults to 10%.\\\\n- Added menus/settings/pause/Dev Mode/log/results/credits, touch gate, attract reel, source/feedback pages.\\\\n- Added Hub host timer, input traffic, compact snapshots/keyframes, card, results, leave/end behavior.\\\\n- Build and browser verification beginning. Need calibrate ranks, add comprehensive test runner, verify visuals, all engine checks and Hub harness.\\\\n- Initial exit-interview.json at root and matching src/content/about.js exist; unknown feedback must be filled from testing.\\\\n\\\\n### Commands / paths\\\\n- Dev folder: Trauma-Ward-Critical-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-031206\\\\n- Build: node tools/build.mjs (in dev folder). Root HTML plus index.html and dist/game.html copies.\\\\n- Required test entry to implement: node tests/run.mjs [sim|content|browser|hub].\\\\n''')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}