{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_118","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('PROGRESS.md')\np.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Verification checkpoint (final suite running)\\\\n- Individual passes before final polish: 90 simulation checks; 45 content/audio checks; 18 browser checks; 3 native engine checks; 5/5 official Hub scenarios; 16 viewport/visual checks.\\\\n- Official Hub passed 2, 3, 4 players; 150ms latency / 50ms jitter / 5% loss; host-leave; renderer-free server host.\\\\n- Inspected actual title, ten anatomy surfaces, six cast portraits, seven sets, and 14 phone/foldable/tablet/desktop screenshots.\\\\n- Fixed visual findings: incorrect tissue color space, low-contrast/cropped operation HUD, portrait occlusion by table, inactive hand groups with null visibility, pause/settings HUD clutter.\\\\n- Improved header to avoid covering task targets; moved injection ring into visible field; inactive hand visibility now strictly boolean.\\\\n- Touch-only gate now handles WebKit coarse-pointer emulation even when maxTouchPoints is zero. Gate screens omit clipped narrow HUD.\\\\n- Attract now begins with a voiced story snippet, then cycles real bot-played cases and a four-hand Consult; exiting input swallowed until neutral; saves untouched.\\\\n- Added native glyph sprites; glove and reticle seat colors; correct two-doctor gift tags; real ghost hands; gel barriers and perfusion color change; paddles and massage hand poses.\\\\n- Network now smooths remote positions over ~120ms, sends live gel masks and dynamic strain guides, and uses a monotonic host transport clock independent of rewindable simulation ticks. Co-op rewind records the activating hand.\\\\n- docs/AUTHORING.md explains extension points and all workflows.\\\\n\\\\n### Current running command\\\\n- Dev folder: \"'`node tools/build.mjs && node tests/run.mjs`'\"\\\\n- Tool exec session ID: 10915. Poll via write_stdin.\\\\n- Expected count: 183 checks (94 sim, 45 content, 4 engine including fully rendered campaign, 19 browser, 5 hub, 16 visual). Confirm from actual result.\\\\n\\\\n### Final remaining work\\\\n1. Resolve any failures in complete suite; only rerun changed scopes.\\\\n2. Inspect regenerated final PNGs, including corrected hand/portrait/HUD layouts and mobile gate.\\\\n3. Update exit-interview.json and src/content/about.js with measured feedback; rebuild and rerun content validation after metadata-only change.\\\\n4. Validate root HTML / interview JSON, update this log with final results, then hand in HTML link plus all required Source Information / Testing Feedback / Engine Feedback / Prompt Feedback in final reply.\\\\n''')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_118","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('PROGRESS.md')\np.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Verification checkpoint (final suite running)\\\\n- Individual passes before final polish: 90 simulation checks; 45 content/audio checks; 18 browser checks; 3 native engine checks; 5/5 official Hub scenarios; 16 viewport/visual checks.\\\\n- Official Hub passed 2, 3, 4 players; 150ms latency / 50ms jitter / 5% loss; host-leave; renderer-free server host.\\\\n- Inspected actual title, ten anatomy surfaces, six cast portraits, seven sets, and 14 phone/foldable/tablet/desktop screenshots.\\\\n- Fixed visual findings: incorrect tissue color space, low-contrast/cropped operation HUD, portrait occlusion by table, inactive hand groups with null visibility, pause/settings HUD clutter.\\\\n- Improved header to avoid covering task targets; moved injection ring into visible field; inactive hand visibility now strictly boolean.\\\\n- Touch-only gate now handles WebKit coarse-pointer emulation even when maxTouchPoints is zero. Gate screens omit clipped narrow HUD.\\\\n- Attract now begins with a voiced story snippet, then cycles real bot-played cases and a four-hand Consult; exiting input swallowed until neutral; saves untouched.\\\\n- Added native glyph sprites; glove and reticle seat colors; correct two-doctor gift tags; real ghost hands; gel barriers and perfusion color change; paddles and massage hand poses.\\\\n- Network now smooths remote positions over ~120ms, sends live gel masks and dynamic strain guides, and uses a monotonic host transport clock independent of rewindable simulation ticks. Co-op rewind records the activating hand.\\\\n- docs/AUTHORING.md explains extension points and all workflows.\\\\n\\\\n### Current running command\\\\n- Dev folder: \"'`node tools/build.mjs && node tests/run.mjs`'\"\\\\n- Tool exec session ID: 10915. Poll via write_stdin.\\\\n- Expected count: 183 checks (94 sim, 45 content, 4 engine including fully rendered campaign, 19 browser, 5 hub, 16 visual). Confirm from actual result.\\\\n\\\\n### Final remaining work\\\\n1. Resolve any failures in complete suite; only rerun changed scopes.\\\\n2. Inspect regenerated final PNGs, including corrected hand/portrait/HUD layouts and mobile gate.\\\\n3. Update exit-interview.json and src/content/about.js with measured feedback; rebuild and rerun content validation after metadata-only change.\\\\n4. Validate root HTML / interview JSON, update this log with final results, then hand in HTML link plus all required Source Information / Testing Feedback / Engine Feedback / Prompt Feedback in final reply.\\\\n''')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
